      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They Broke this again with the IK 2.0 beta update forward.\nWhen I have avatars that have VRCstation's on them my avatar lags or frezzes in place for everybody else, dose it worse when I have 4 to 6 stations on an avatar. Seats are on both Wrists, Shoulders, and Knees. Also I am using the Index with Index controllers, don't seam to break for users with other headset types though. Using latest SDK version too.",
